  "description": "Adds a creative mode tab for items that are normally obtainable via /give.",
  "body": "Adds a creative mode tab for items that are normally obtainable via /give.\n\nMenu:\n\n<a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/\">\n         <img alt=\"Menu\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/S3QXXRJ.png\"\n         width=200\" height=\"200\">\n</a>\n\nThis includes items that have enchantments at level 127 and unstackable items stacked to 64.\n\nItems that have enchantments at level 127:\n\n<a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/\">\n         <img alt=\"Menu\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wPtVmM1.png\"\n         width=200\" height=\"200\">\n</a>\n\nUnstackable items stacked to 64 (incompatible with 1.19.3):\n\n<a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/\">\n         <img alt=\"Menu\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SgLzMSG.png\"\n         width=200\" height=\"200\">\n</a>",
